cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use FormalSLT, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "FormalSLT: Formal Statistical Learning Theory in Lean 4"
authors:
  - family-names: Sneiderman
    given-names: Robert
year: 2026
url: "https://github.com/Robby955/FormalSLT"
repository-code: "https://github.com/Robby955/FormalSLT"
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  Lean 4 formalization of statistical learning theory and sequential
  inference, including all-sample-size empirical-Bernstein PAC-Bayes bounds,
  adaptive trajectory inference, finite-state stationary and unknown-kernel
  certification, and finite-sample Rademacher, VC, stability, and chaining
  results with explicit assumptions and axiom audits.
